strip 2 cols
panel "The ask" note "Two words, three meanings."
  client: figure sad @left "Client"
  me: figure @right "You (consultant)"
  client says "I need the\nsales dashboard\nLIVE." accent
  me says "...define\n'live'?"
panel "DirectQuery: live, with a bill" note "Live, but you pay for it on every click."
  me: figure @left "You (consultant)"
  rpt: box "Report"
  db: box "Source\nDB"
  rpt -> db "query"
  me says "Every click = a query.\nSlow visuals, busy source."
  stat "20 users x 6 clicks\n= 120 queries a minute" bad
panel "The fix: Import + refresh" note "Ask 'how fresh?' before 'how live?'."
  client: figure happy @left "Client"
  rpt: box "Report\n(cached)" good
  db: box "Source\nDB"
  db -> rpt "every 15 min" good
  client says "Fresh within 15 min?\nYes! That is live enough."
  stat "Fast visuals,\nquiet source." good
